{"title":"1605.09522 Kernel Mean Embedding of Distributions: A Review and Beyond","markdown":{"headingText":"1605.09522 Kernel Mean Embedding of Distributions: A Review and Beyond","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Krikamol Muandet, Kenji Fukumizu, Bharath Sriperumbudur, Bernhard Schölkopf；2016-05-31（v4 2020-12-13）；arXiv:1605.09522\n- **一句话定位**：关于分布的核均值嵌入（kernel mean embedding）的系统性综述，梳理把概率测度嵌入再生核希尔伯特空间（RKHS）的理论保证（特征核、收敛速率）及其在两样本检验、独立性检验、分布数据学习、概率推断与因果发现中的应用。\n- **研究问题**：如何把\"分布\"本身作为可计算对象——将 P 映入 RKHS，使核方法的全套工具可以作用于概率测度，并回答：嵌入保留多少信息、何时无信息损失、经验估计的统计性质如何、能支撑哪些应用。\n- **模型与方法**：核均值嵌入 μ: P ↦ μ_P = ∫ k(x,·) dP(x)（Definition 3.1）；Lemma 3.1：若 E[k(X,X)]<∞ 则 μ_P∈H 且 E_P[f(X)]=⟨f,μ_P⟩——期望成为 RKHS 内积。线性核只保留一阶矩，多项式核保留到相应阶矩，高斯核等特征核（characteristic kernel，Definition 3.2：P↦μ_P 单射）则无信息损失：‖μ_P−μ_Q‖=0 当且仅当 P=Q；紧集上通用核（universal kernel，RKHS 在 C_b(X) 中稠密）蕴含特征核，高斯、拉普拉斯核在 R^d 上特征。经验估计 μ̂_P=(1/n)Σ k(x_i,·)。条件分布嵌入 U_{Y|X}=C_{YX}C_{XX}^{-1}（Definition 4.1，C 为协方差/互协方差算子），满足 E[g(Y)|X=x]=⟨g,U_{Y|x}⟩；因 C_{XX} 紧致需正则化 C_{YX}(C_{XX}+λI)^{-1}，经验式为 S_y^*(K+nλI)^{-1}k_x（式 4.7），使求和、乘积与贝叶斯法则等推断操作可以非参数地在嵌入空间完成。综述还覆盖 MMD（最大均值差异，两分布距离 γ(μ_P,μ_Q)）、核依赖度量（协方差算子的 HS 范数→HSIC）、学习原像（pre-image）、分布数据上的学习及与切片逆回归、深度生成模型等的联系。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 3.4：有界核（sup k(x,x)≤C_k<∞、可分拓扑空间）下以概率 1−δ 有 ‖μ̂_P−μ_P‖ ≤ √(C_k/n)+√(2C_k log(1/δ)/n)，即 O(n^{-1/2})，且 Tolstikhin et al. (2016) 证明该速率极小化最优；√n(μ̂_P−μ_P) 收敛到零均值高斯过程。Theorem 3.6：MMD 的无偏二次时间 U 统计量形式及检验一致性。Theorem 4.1：在 C_{XX} 单射、μ_Π∈R(C_{XX})、E[g(Y)|X=·]∈H 条件下，条件分布的嵌入满足 μ_{Q_y}=C_{YX}C_{XX}^{-1}μ_Π，是嵌入空间中做贝叶斯推断的基础；Theorem 4.2 给出经验条件嵌入的收敛刻画。以上均为对既有文献结果的整理（引用 Smola et al. 2007、Fukumizu et al. 2004/2013、Song et al. 2009、Gretton et al. 2012、Sriperumbudur et al. 2010 等），综述本身无新定理，末章讨论未来方向（嵌入的降维与逼近、非欧数据、与深度学习的结合等）。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：核均值嵌入是 Schölkopf 学派因果工具箱的公共基础设施：HSIC 独立性检验、基于核的条件独立性检验、两样本检验、以及把分布作为样本的\"因果推断即分类\"方法（如 NCC）都以它为语言；本综述是该领域的权威参考（后发表于 Foundations and Trends in Machine Learning）。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1605.09522.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title